# Keep GitHub's language stats focused on hand-written code.
# Flutter platform runners are generated boilerplate (C++, CMake, Swift, Kotlin, ...).
**/android/** linguist-generated
**/ios/** linguist-generated
**/linux/** linguist-generated
**/macos/** linguist-generated
**/windows/** linguist-generated
**/web/index.html linguist-generated

# Lock files
**/package-lock.json linguist-generated
**/pubspec.lock linguist-generated
**/bun.lockb linguist-generated binary

# Course PDFs / slides are documentation, not code
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
